This directory holds the operator's product portfolio. Each product gets its
own subdirectory instantiating the schema in `../product-template/`:

  products/
    product-1/
      _meta.md
      vision.md
      function.md
      users.md
      requirements.md
      scale.md
      constraints.md
      operability.md
      reliability.md
      quality-bar.md
      security.md
      roadmap.md
      decisions/
        YYYY-MM-DD-<slug>.md
        ...
    product-2/
      ...

This `.keep` file marks the directory as operator-owned at the manifest layer:
swarm-init seeds it once; sync and --force never touch it. The cpo agent
authors content into this tree through the refine → write → ratify protocol
(see MEMORY.md).
